    "clearanceAmendmentPerformed": false,
    "reason": "The shared drawing captions explicitly include X4K3, their power ranges cover all ten table entries, and the drawings immediately follow the TMGi X4K3 tables before the separate TMGiN chapter. This is positive applicability evidence for a representative exterior despite a nomenclature inconsistency. It is stronger than inference from page adjacency alone. The mismatch prevents an exact-identity assertion, not every source-supported illustrative use.",
